# GuardChasePose ($A5:E812) past its 96-frame wait: as cov_guard_states.box's
# section "GuardWait state 1 with $146B bit 7" (the first level's guard, record
# $092B, its state $4D 1 with $146B $80: its code word $E812), played on for
# 130 frames, so after COP $60 it takes pose $15 and stays ($A5:E81D-E825).
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 10
poke 00146B 80
poke 000978 01
wait 130
